xt", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn7le04ob07re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Let's leave a message. "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn7le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le04ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hi Miranda. Peter's not come in today, has he?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Nope. I'm not surprised. He seemed pretty put out that we were expected to be here yesterday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: He was certainly smug when the storm did head this way and I announced the office was closing.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Smug! He tends to be conceited.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Ummm, I suppose you'd have told me if you'd received the proposal from him yet. Doesn't he also have a tendency to come through?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No and yes. No correspondence from him, but yes, he usually does deliver.", "id": 1}, {"time": "32000", "image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Alright, I guess I do know that. I hardly get bothered by things like this but I'll admit I'm more apprehensive now with so much depending on the deadline. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Would you feel more relieved if you spoke to him? I can call him.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Why don't you try?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Answering Machine</span>: Hello, this is Peter Smith. Sorry to have missed your call. Please leave your message after the beep.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Hello, Peter. This is Miranda from the office. We haven't heard from you hope you're well despite the storm yesterday. It's 11:30 and we were wondering about the state of the proposal. Please give us a call when you get this message. Thank you.", "id": 2}, {"time": "83000", "image": "engenn7le04ob07re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I hate answering machines.<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Go have a coffee. I'll call you if there's news. <br/><br/>\n<span class=\"italic\">Twenty-five minutes later ... </span><br/><br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Miranda! There's a fax coming through!<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Peter's proposal! Well, he did make a point of sticking to his word. Five minutes before the deadline - how typical of Peter!", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Preparing the Proposal"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Will Peter Come Through?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le04ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Habits"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In the Business world, it is important to talk about things that are part of your daily life. <br/><br/>Normally, the <span class=\"strong\">Present Simple tense</span>  is used to describe activities you do on a daily basis. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the following expressions to describe habits. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expression \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Verb form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I (often) tend to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He <span class=\\\"strong\\\">tends to be</span> on time.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I have a tendency to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He <span class=\\\"strong\\\">has a tendency to meet</span> deadlines.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I usually ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He <span class=\\\"strong\\\">usually meets</span> his deadlines. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I hardly ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" main verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hardly feel</span> pressured at work.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I (always) make a point of ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" verb - ing \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">always make a point of</span> meet<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ing deadlines. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Leaving A Phone Message"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Talking on the telephone can be challenging for a variety of reasons. Firstly, you are not able to see the person you're talking to, so there's no body language to be read. Secondly, it requires a special set of words, phrases, and expressions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The chart below will help you to leave a message on the phone confidently in business and personal situations. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Voicemail Message</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello, this is Peter Smith. Sorry to have missed your call.  Please leave your message after the beep.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Leaving a Message</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hello, _____ (person's name). This is _______ (your name) from _________ (company).\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">1. Introduction</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hello, _____ (person's name). This is _______ (your name) from _________ (company).\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 2. Reason for calling</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm calling to let you know that ... (clause)<br/>I'm calling to tell you that ...  (clause)<br/>I'm calling because ... (clause) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 3. Request for a call back</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Please give ____ (name) a call when you get this message.<br/>Could you ring me to ... (confirm / discuss / talk about) <br/>Could you give me a call back to ... (verb) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 4. Contact information </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can call / reach / get me on _________ (number). <br/>I'll be in the office until / between / from _________ (time)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> 5. Ending </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Thank you / Talk later / Bye. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Hello, Mark. This is Mary calling from the HR office. I'm calling because we haven't heard from you. It's 1 pm and we were wondering about the proposal. Please give me a call when you get this message. Thank you!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be put out "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be upset"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter was put out that he had to be in the office yesterday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when talking about habits. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "smug"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "looking or feeling too pleased about something you have done or achieved"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He tends to be smug."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "conceited"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thinking you are very clever or skillful"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He tends to be conceited."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "apprehensive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "worried or frightened that something unpleasant may happen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm apprehensive with so much depending on the deadline."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "relieved"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "feeling happy because you are no longer worried about something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm relieved that he called!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le04ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create a short answering machine voice message to use when your partner calls you. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about a problem you are having in the office (for example, your co-worker did not write an e-mail you asked him/her to)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Create a short voice message to send to him/her."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make sure your message includes an introduction, a reason for calling, a request for call back, your contact information, and an ending. If possible, describe the situation using an expression to describe a habit. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "\u201cCall\u201d your partner and read your voice message to him/her. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are finished, switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I think of a possible problem in the office. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a short and detailed voice message including an introduction, reason for calling, request for a call back, my contact information, and an ending. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about habits. "}]}]}